0 < 1 # Architecture decision records
1 < 1 
2 < 1 The code carries no comments (`lint/comments.py`, ratcheted by `tests/test_comment_ratchet.py`).
3 < 1 A non-obvious decision a reader needs and cannot recover from the code lives here instead, one
4 < 1 file per decision area, named by the files and symbols it governs, never by line number.
5 < 1 
6 < 1 Each record has this shape:
7 < 1 
8 < 1 ```
9 < 1 # NNNN. <Subsystem>
10 < 1 
11 < 1 Status: accepted (YYYY-MM-DD)
12 < 1 Governs: `<file>`, …
13 < 1 
14 < 1 ## <Decision area>
15 < 1 
16 < 1 - **<symbol>** — context, decision and consequence in plain words, self-contained.
17 < 1 ```
18 < 1 
19 < 1 A decision that stops being true is struck through with the date and the superseding record,
20 < 1 not deleted. `/delete-comment` adds to these records; so can any hand change.
21 < 1 
